    <name>HURT 100 full loop</name>
    <desc>Track coordinates are an exact copy of the 1,230 route points in the organizer's official HURT100.gpx (CALTOPO export, downloaded 2026-08-13 from the hurt100.com course-map page), converted from rtept to trkpt because Ultrainfo reads tracks. Station waypoints come from the organizer's Google My Maps "HURT 100 Course" placemarks. The 100-mile race runs 5 laps of this loop. Neither organizer file carries track elevations.</desc>
    <link href="https://hurt100.com/course-map/"><text>HURT100 course map page</text></link>
